Task: Construct a pipeline to improve a system of norms. 

Ethics is very much about trying things out and then adjust them on the way. 
Legal codes also evolve and might be revised at times.
Construct a pipeline that does it automatically, test it, and present your findings. 

Use the LogiKey methodology to setup your experiments.
You may use LLM-agents to generate norms, automatic theorem provers to test them, and this dataset or others to find cases.  
